{"tool_name":"icy-3d-rotation-","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<blockquote>\n<p>The 3D Rotation plug-in allows you to record a 360 degree rotation of the current focused 3D VTK viewer about the vertical screen axis.</p>\n\n<p>The 'angle step' parameter indicates the deviation in degrees between two consecutive snapshots. Increasing the angle will increase rotation speed (up to a point where it might look like jumping more than rotating) and reduce the final movie length.</p>\n</blockquote>","summary":"","value":"<blockquote>\r\n<p>The 3D Rotation plug-in allows you to record a 360 degree rotation of the current focused 3D VTK viewer about the vertical screen axis.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The 'angle step' parameter indicates the deviation in degrees between two consecutive snapshots. Increasing the angle will increase rotation speed (up to a point where it might look like jumping more than rotating) and reduce the final movie length.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-03-02T13:30:19+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-11T13:08:43+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4465,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"da111da4-3e5a-4216-b292-7adacf86e6f2","url":"/taxonomy/term/4465"},{"target_id":4466,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"00354ffa-0c44-4ff9-a403-b0bc9b2443ee","url":"/taxonomy/term/4466"},{"target_id":4467,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"ae5f4f2f-9e27-41d4-ae69-a82a258b6f97","url":"/taxonomy/term/4467"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505206710,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Alexandre Dufour"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":98,"target